</div></section>
<section id="advertise"><h2 class="title">Advertise With Us</h2><div class="box form">
 <p>Choose an advertising package and a mobile money payment method. Confirm the amount with the administrator before sending money.</p>
 <label>Business name</label><input id="advertiseName" placeholder="Your business name">
