</div></section>
<section id="about"><h2 class="title">About Malawi Directly</h2><div class="box"><p>Malawi Directly is a business directory designed to help people discover businesses and help local businesses reach more customers.</p><p class="small">Business information should be checked before customers make purchases or payments.</p></div></section>
<section id="contact"><h2 class="title">Contact Malawi Directly</h2><div class="box form"><p>For listing support, advertising and corrections, contact the directory administrator.</p><label>Directory WhatsApp number</label><p id="directoryPhoneDisplay">Add your WhatsApp number in the code settings.</p><p class="small">To change the number, update DIRECTORY_WHATSAPP near the top of the JavaScript section.</p></div></section>

<section id="privacy">
  <h2 class="title">Privacy Policy</h2>
  <div class="box">
    <p><strong>Last updated: 31 October 2026</strong></p>
    <p>Malawi Directly is a business directory that helps people discover businesses and contact them. This policy explains what information may be collected when you use the website.</p>

    <h3>1. Information we may collect</h3>
    <p>When a business submits a listing, we may collect its business name, category, district, location, phone number, WhatsApp number, email address, description, opening hours, website or map details, and other information entered in the form. Advertising enquiries may include a contact name or business name, phone number, selected package, payment method and transaction reference.</p>

    <h3>2. How information is used</h3>
    <p>We use submitted information to review and publish business listings, operate the directory, respond to enquiries, manage advertising requests, verify payments manually, administer promotions and prevent misuse of the service.</p>

    <h3>3. Public information</h3>
    <p>Once a listing is approved, information included in that listing may be visible to anyone visiting the directory. Do not submit private information that you do not want displayed publicly. Do not submit another person's personal details unless you have permission.</p>

    <h3>4. Storage and service providers</h3>
    <p>Website listing information is stored using Google Firebase services. Information may be processed or stored on systems outside Malawi, depending on the service configuration. We do not ask users to enter mobile money PINs, passwords or one-time security codes into this website.</p>

    <h3>5. Sharing</h3>
    <p>We do not intend to sell submitted personal information. Information may be shared where needed to operate the website and its connected services, respond to a lawful request, protect users or investigate suspected fraud. Business contact details in approved listings are shared publicly as part of the directory.</p>

    <h3>6. Accuracy, access and removal requests</h3>
    <p>Business owners are responsible for ensuring their submitted information is accurate and that they are authorised to publish it. To request a correction or removal, contact the Malawi Directly administrator using the contact details shown on this website. We may ask for reasonable information to confirm that you are authorised to make the request.</p>

    <h3>7. Security and retention</h3>
    <p>We use access controls and administrative procedures intended to protect information, but no online service can guarantee absolute security. We keep information for as long as reasonably needed to operate the directory, manage listings and advertising, resolve disputes, and meet applicable obligations.</p>

    <h3>8. Children and changes</h3>
    <p>This directory is intended for general business and public use, not for collecting children's personal information. We may update this policy when the service changes. The latest version will be displayed on this page.</p>

    <p class="small">Questions or privacy requests: use the Contact section of Malawi Directly.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="terms">
  <h2 class="title">Terms of Use & Advertising Terms</h2>
  <div class="box">
    <p><strong>Last updated: 31 October 2026</strong></p>
    <p>By using Malawi Directly, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the website.</p>

    <h3>1. What the directory does</h3>
    <p>Malawi Directly provides a platform for discovering businesses and contacting them. A listing is not a guarantee, endorsement or certification of a business, its products, services, quality, licensing or conduct. Users should make their own checks before paying a business or entering an agreement.</p>

    <h3>2. Business listing rules</h3>
    <p>People submitting listings must provide accurate information and must have authority to submit it. Do not submit false, misleading, unlawful, abusive, infringing or fraudulent content. Do not list another person's contact details without permission. Listings may be reviewed, rejected, edited, unpublished or removed where necessary.</p>

    <h3>3. Advertising packages and prices</h3>
    <p>The current advertised package prices are:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Featured – 7 days: MWK 3,000</li>
      <li>Featured – 30 days: MWK 10,000</li>
      <li>Premium – 30 days: MWK 20,000</li>
      <li>Banner Advertising – 30 days: MWK 25